    description: "Message queue and worker configuration."
    shapeIndex: 1
    mamlText: "{\n  broker: \"redis\"\n  connection: {\n    host: \"mq.internal\"\n    port: 9092\n    vhost: \"/staging\"\n  }\n\n  # Queue definitions\n  queues: {\n    default: {\n      concurrency: 3\n      retry: 2\n      timeout: 51204 # ms\n    }\n\n    priority: {\n      concurrency: 19\n      retry: 5\n      timeout: 6635 # ms\n    }\n  }\n\n  dead_letter: {\n    enabled: true\n    max_retries: 5\n    queue: \"dead-letter\"\n  }\n}"
