    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Garam Masala-spiced Asparagus Bowl\"\n  servings: 8\n  prep_time: \"50 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"114 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"2 lbs chicken\"\n    \"1 tsp apple cider vinegar\"\n    \"3 oz cumin\"\n    \"2 oz capers\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A special fuchsia besan from Canada. To support the strong flavor it is sided with a tablespoon of colombo.\"\n    \"A classic pie filled with delicious emu and fluffy apples, baked in a juicy pastry crust and topped with a golden-brown lattice.\"\n    \"A delightful tart combining creamy celery and sweet prune, set in a buttery pastry shell and finished with a hint of ajwain seed.\"\n    \"A salty french eschallots creation, seasoned with mustard and kaffir leaves, showcasing the best of plant-based cuisine.\"\n    \"Crispy fried salmon bites, seasoned with baharat and served with a tangy grape dipping sauce.\"\n    \"A crunchy eggplant creation, seasoned with chilli and ras-el-hanout, showcasing the best of plant-based cuisine.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 279\n    protein: \"13g\"\n    carbs: \"68g\"\n    fat: \"27g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
